msgid "Add PPSA99360 to your HEN's app jailbreak list (etaHEN: its app jailbreak list; OnionHEN: the end of exact_title_ids in config.ini, with no comma after it), or have elfldr listening on port 9021. Then start PS5CEMU-HAR again."
msgstr "Přidejte PPSA99360 do seznamu app jailbreak vašeho HEN (etaHEN: jeho seznam app jailbreak; OnionHEN: na konec exact_title_ids v config.ini, bez čárky za ním), nebo nechte elfldr naslouchat na portu 9021. Pak PS5CEMU-HAR spusťte znovu."

